re commit? In prior tasks, after request_authorization, you commit. Verify might be for checking candidate? But if authorization returned, commit is next. The task says \"Deliver an accurate authoritative result and receipt/state reference.\" So after commit, get receipt and state. But one next action. Commit.\n\nLet's ensure idempotency_key. Could use authorization_id? But idempotency_key minLength 1. Since no explicit, any unique string. But maybe idempotency_key should be candidate_id? We can use \"a1-c1\". It's fine.\n\nReturn exactly JSON object. No markdown.","signature":"3f3591cd-b9b9-43cc-84c4-0f0847812bf0"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"kind\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"commit\",\"arguments_json\":\"{\\\"candidate_id\\\":\\\"c1\\\",\\\"authorization_id\\\":\\\"a1\\\",\\\"committed_value\\\":5143,\\\"idempotency_key\\\":\\\"commit-P2F-FORMAL-R-001-quantity-a1\\\"}\",\"report_json\":\"{}\"}"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":188,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":1792,"output_tokens":1017,"service_tier":"standard"}}